81\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{9}v\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo we have $T(v)=\\frac{1}{9}v,$ and so the linear transformation $T$ is a dilation with scale factor $k=\\frac{1}{9}.$\n\nThe matrix that represents a dilation of scale factor $k$ is given by\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}k & 0 \\\\ 0 & k\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, the standard matrix of $T$ is\n\n$$\nT=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{9} & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\frac{1}{9}\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-78295/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "166cd7e4-5568-5769-8bc6-4ffc4ed8b508"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-78295"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-275741/field-1/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "4073c80c-940d-5e0e-be1f-922bd077ff76" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-275741/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "d610250f-2f12-579c-89be-e21e9e32036e" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-275741/field-1/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer-field/choices ["q-275741/field-1/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-275741/field-2/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "5cd6c76b-b561-51cc-9dfb-620d5004e16f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-275741/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "0c4e4682-5605-576d-9b9e-4f93301557e6" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-275741/field-2/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer-field/choices ["q-275741/field-2/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-275741/field-3/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "573d11fe-f168-5694-9e5d-e084b7a21207" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-275741/field-3" :answer-field/id #uuid "09699a05-2c9b-5c63-9279-e63a126234b0" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-275741/field-3/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer-field/choices ["q-275741/field-3/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-275741/field-4/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "ec3195d7-179d-5b5c-b3b0-66c6a37ef464" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-275741/field-4" :answer-field/id #uuid "5f65501b-4364-5cc8-8739-8ece7041cac6" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-275741/field-4/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer-field/choices ["q-275741/field-4/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-275741" :question/id #uuid "ef035e6f-20ac-50ef-9479-1744ff9ac796" :question/math-academy-id "q-275741" :question/problem "A  linear transformation $T$ represents a dilation. Given that $v=[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}]$ and $T(v)=[\\begin{aligned}-6 \\\\ 15\\end{aligned}],$ what is the standard matrix $T$ of $T?$\n\n| $T=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} | {{field-2}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-3}} | {{field-4}} |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "We can write $T(v)$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T(v) & =[\\begin{aligned}-6 \\\\ 15\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =3\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =3v\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo we have $T(v)=3v,$ and so the linear transformation $T$ is a dilation with scale factor $k=3.$\n\nThe matrix that represents a dilation of scale factor $k$ is given by\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}k & 0 \\\\ 0 & k\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, the standard matrix of $T$ is\n\n$$\nT=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-275741/field-1" "q-275741/field-2" "q-275741/field-3" "q-275741/field-4"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "166cd7e4-5568-5769-8bc6-4ffc4ed8b508"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-275741"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-12043/selection/e37ecd3d677144201dd1a2e78fde156cc49022e18509cf04a18c58aba0184cb6" :answer/id #uuid "4e8d9aac-82fe-5314-8dcd-f155fdaf2e04" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Reflection in the line $y=12$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-12043/selection/fce25706ad846e84aee0bb5f1f92768d6e5c92bb13c1953f1297f12eadf3e6b0" :answer/id #uuid "c4c055da-2be3-5f07-876f-79488482b53a" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Reflection in the line $x=12$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-12043/selection/f87753f66403a0595fdf0f5a25c3e881069d5c729f8d641afe0f47a65a4201dc" :answer/id #uuid "5b975215-a5a1-5e6a-9a97-1a27ac5cafd5" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Dilation with scale factor $\\frac{1}{12}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-12043/selection/9268e85b3c7f046b09543b25597692b7ebd6d944eb024975e1db64e626f34a4a" :answer/id #uuid "2b4fdafe-a381-526f-9e3f-bc8756696836" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Dilation with scale factor $12$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-12043/selection/83351679bef40cdde3e69e55c2c6f08222a317ed82557f1e3ec0abdce5a513f4" :answer/id #uuid "ac2c45bf-ce21-5500-b6b8-4a67992f33e1" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Reflection across the $y$-axis" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-12043/selection" :answer-field/id #uu